{{!
    @template local_awareness/manage/cell_audience

    The Audience cell: the reach count with a statement of what it is a count OF.

    The number is never shown on its own. A count computed before the filters changed is not
    merely old — it describes a different notice — so it is labelled "filters changed since"
    rather than being silently presented as current.

    bg-warning takes text-dark and bg-info takes text-white explicitly: Bootstrap 4 gives .badge no
    colour and Bootstrap 5 defaults it to white, so the two branches fail on disjoint fills.
    tests/local/bootstrap_compat_test.php enforces the pairing.

    Context variables required:
    * pending (bool) — an estimate is queued, so there is no number yet
    * pendinglabel (string) — the queued sentence
    * never (bool) — no estimate has ever been computed
    * neverlabel (string) — the never-computed sentence
    * value (string) — the formatted reach sentence
    * when (string) — when it was computed, or that the filters changed since
    * stale (bool) — whether "when" is a warning rather than a note
    * hascohorts (bool) — whether a cohort restriction line is shown
    * cohortline (string) — that line
    * cohortlist (string) — the plain list, used as the title attribute
    * hasgroups - whether the notice names groups
    * groupline - the sentence naming them
    * grouplist - the names alone, for the title

    Example context (json):
    {
        "pending": false,
        "pendinglabel": "Calculating",
        "never": false,
        "neverlabel": "Not calculated",
        "value": "Reaches 1,240 people",
        "when": "Filters changed since 3/03/26, 09:14",
        "stale": true,
        "hascohorts": true,
        "cohortline": "Cohorts: First years",
        "cohortlist": "First years",
        "hasgroups": true,
        "groupline": "Groups: Red team",
        "grouplist": "Red team"
    }
}}
{{#pending}}
    <span class="badge bg-info text-white">{{pendinglabel}}</span>
{{/pending}}
{{^pending}}
    {{#never}}
        <span class="text-muted">{{neverlabel}}</span>
    {{/never}}
    {{^never}}
        <span class="d-block">{{value}}</span>
        {{#stale}}<span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">{{when}}</span>{{/stale}}
        {{^stale}}<span class="text-muted small">{{when}}</span>{{/stale}}
        {{#hascohorts}}
            <span class="local-awareness-subline" title="{{cohortlist}}">{{cohortline}}</span>
        {{/hascohorts}}
        {{#hasgroups}}
            <span class="local-awareness-subline" title="{{grouplist}}">{{groupline}}</span>
        {{/hasgroups}}
    {{/never}}
{{/pending}}
